.TH NDICLIENT 1 "October 2026" "ndiclient 0.1.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
ndiclient \- 
command line NDI video and audio monitor
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B ndiclient
.br
.B ndiclient
.RB [ \-\-fullscreen ]
.RB [ \-\-noaudio ]
.I device-name
.RI [ stream-name ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B ndiclient
uses mDNS or an NDI discovery server to find an NDI device and source on the 
network, render its video stream in a desktop window or fullscreen and play
its audio on the default sound output.
.PP

If you pass no arguments,
.B ndiclient
will search for 5 seconds, prints the full NDI name of each source that is 
discovered, then exit. Use this to list broadcast sources.
.PP
With arguments, it shows the source named
.IR DEVICE_NAME " (" STREAM_NAME ).
The device name matches ignoring case; the stream name must match exactly.
Without a stream name, the first stream discovered on the device is shown.
.PP
Audio plays about 60 to 200 milliseconds behind its arrival, which smooths
out network jitter. Short dropouts of digital silence (up to 10 milliseconds)
that some senders insert are bridged so they do not crackle. Only the first
two channels (front left and right) are
played. If no sound output can be opened, a warning is printed and the video
is still shown.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-\-fullscreen
Go into "kiosk mode" instead of running within a window.
.TP
.B \-\-noaudio
Do not play the source's audio. No audio device is opened.
.SH KEYS
.PP
.BR F11 ", " F
Switch between window and fullscreen.
.PP
.BR Escape
Quit either in fullscreen or windowed mode.
.SH EXIT STATUS
.PP
.B 0
Success, also when listing finds no sources.
.PP
.B 1
No matching source was found within 10 seconds, or another error occurred.
.SH ENVIRONMENT
When run over SSH, export the desktop session first, for example
.B XDG_RUNTIME_DIR=/run/user/$(id \-u)
and
.BR WAYLAND_DISPLAY=wayland\-0 .
.SH EXAMPLES
.PP
.B ndiclient
List the NDI sources on the network.
.PP
.B ndiclient STUDIO \(dqOBS PGM\(dq
Show the source
.BR "STUDIO (OBS PGM)" .
.PP
.B ndiclient \-\-fullscreen STUDIO
Show the first stream of device STUDIO fullscreen.
.PP
.B ndiclient \-\-noaudio STUDIO
Show the first stream of device STUDIO without its audio.
